 era, with a platform for agentic operation and resilience that no competitor can match.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/rubrik-rbrk-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBRK 2027 Q1","e":"rbrk","d":"2026-06-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kiran Choudary","x":"We are pleased with our solid start to fiscal year 2027 and are raising our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/rubrik-rbrk-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBRK 2027 Q1","e":"rbrk","d":"2026-06-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Bipul Sinha","x":"So -- and because of all of that, and this is one of the reasons that we have actually -- we have increased our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/rubrik-rbrk-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBRK 2027 Q2","e":"rbrk","d":"2026-08-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bipul Sinha","x":"And as you can imagine, digital infrastructure and AI infrastructure is an important economic infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/rubrik-rbrk-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBRK 2027 Q2","e":"rbrk","d":"2026-08-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bipul Sinha","x":"I'm pleased to report we are once again raising our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/rubrik-rbrk-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBRK 2027 Q2","e":"rbrk","d":"2026-08-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bipul Sinha","x":"Accelerating net new ARR, expanding margins and raised outlook show our confidence that this is a durable execution at scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/rubrik-rbrk-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[63,1,7500,0,0,0,6069,1118],[64,1,8009,0,0,0,6352,1275],[65,1,7560,0,0,0,1506,5668],[66,1,8074,0,0,0,6273,1371]],"cinema":[[63,1,7500,0,0,0,6069,1118],[64,1,8009,0